  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "RANDOM COLOUR\n\nA pad with a robot on its\nback. Each round it rolls a\ndie and picks a colour from\na LIST -- a box of seven\n[name | ink] pairs -- then\nsends itself three letters:\n  [set | background | name]\n  [set | text | name]\n  [set | colour | ink]\n\nPress SPACE on it. \".\" stops."
   },
   "x": -1.3,
   "z": 2.1
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "PICKING THE Nth\n\nThe die lands on a number\nas its roll; a -1 makes it\n0 to 6. A copy of the list\ndropped on that number\nSPLITS there, and the rest\nbegins with the colour\nwanted.\n\nHold the pad and press\nCtrl+P to watch the robot\ndo it."
   },
   "x": -0.55,
   "z": 2.1
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "MORE COLOURS\n\nOpen the panel, take the\ncolour list off the desk,\nand join another [name |\nink] pair on its right edge.\nThen hold the die and type\nthe new number of faces.\n\nAny colour the browser\nknows by name works --\ntry \"hotpink\", \"gold\" and\n\"teal\"."
   },
   "x": 0.2,
   "z": 2.1
  }
